C ELM26A              WHICH PHYSICAL PARAMETERS HAVE RANDOM VARIATIONS
C
C DPAR      VARIATION IN PARAMETER
C TYPER     TYPE CODE OF ELEMENT WITH VARIED PARAMETER
C NPAR      NUMBER OF PARAMETER TO BE VARIED
C RANZC     INDICATOR IF BEAM LINE CONTAINS RANDOMIZED PARAMETERS
C RANZD     INDICATOR IF ELEMENT CONTAINS RANDOMIZED PARAMETERS
C
      INTEGER         TYPER, NPAR
      LOGICAL         RANZC, RANZD
      REAL            DPAR
C
      COMMON /ELM26A/ DPAR, TYPER, NPAR, RANZC, RANZD
